## Bundled as a git submodule

**Open Wallet Standard core (`ows-core/`)** — https://github.com/Kenbak/core
MIT License. Pinned to commit ede3e58. Provides the encrypted vault (scrypt + AES-256-GCM)
and the signer used by the CLI and MCP server. This is a personal fork of the OWS core repo,
not the organisation's; Zumbra will pin or vendor it after review.

