## Network resources

- **Sapling parameters** are downloaded from download.z.cash on first use and verified against
  pinned SHA-256 hashes before they are used.
- **lightwalletd / Zaino servers** are chosen by the operator. Zumbra ships no default operator
  endpoint after the rename; the light client protocol reveals your IP and transparent addresses to
  whichever server you choose. Shielded viewing keys never leave the machine.

